<title>NETHERLANDS: DIARY - Dutch economic indicators week of Oct 28.</title>
<headline>DIARY - Dutch economic indicators week of Oct 28.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said it planned to publish the following key Dutch economic indicators next week.</p>
<p>GMT----date----indicator------------period---previous</p>
<p>    0830  28/10    consumer confidence  Oct	+8</p>
<p>    0830  29/10    business confidence  Sept     +0.08</p>
<p>    0830  29/10    manufacturing</p>
<p>			 capacity utilisation Q3	 84.0 pct</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
